description=Small fixes for the CookieCheetah server: Daily Challenge pins found by its nearby scan only (no scan of every loaded square), Kentucky Cannabis per-square item pass removed and stock screen shader kept, Lifestyle and More Traits error guards, Building Clipboard leftovers (staff check, room cleanup, erosion sent once), PhunMart hides items of removed mods, Monorails build-menu track made plain, Guns of Marz Picatinny Rail goes Up, Legendary Tactical Weapons need a seal to craft, Mythical katana/axe can break and be repaired, admin vehicle skin switch, temporary light switch scan (log only), The Only Cure+ Cyber arm Strength bonus given by the server and a SyncXp guard (no more "PlayerXp: no capability" kicks), Simple Silencers no longer replaces the Gunworks weapon-upgrade action (Guns of Marz muzzles and rails attach as Gunworks intends; Simple Silencers suppressors keep their screwdriver rule), Project A-Life Thai translation NPC lines no longer show as garbled text in multiplayer. The five maps added mid-season (Frogtown, Raccoon City, Raven Creek, Constown, AnruisiTown) get town zones over their buildings at server start, so their loot respawns like town loot. Working vehicles can be dismantled for scrap like a car wreck (welding mask + propane torch, Mechanics 6 and Electrical 3, 20% more salvage than a wreck); vehicles claimed with Another Vehicle Claim System, with someone inside or with items left inside cannot be.
